From bc42ca6f54789b241e8f0f6986efbfe5fcb4f30d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cgscli <cgscli@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:42:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] P7: CGS channels are priced in yuan and billed by the
 relay

Reason: CGS prices are the site's real yuan prices, and the relay (not omp) is the billing authority. cgs-* models show a yuan sign in the model picker, omp records no cost for them (they would otherwise land in omp's totals in dollars), the usage unit `cny` lets the CGS extension show the wallet on /usage in yuan, and the login with its four channels is shown as one service name. Every branch is new; other providers are unchanged.
Upstream: none yet (CGS-specific provider prefix, not a candidate PR)
Remove-when: the build no longer ships the cgs extension, or upstream supports per-provider currency, display names and externally billed providers
